      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/dale_oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Dale was platted along the Rock Island railroad line before Oklahoma achieved statehood in 1907.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
