        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dale%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dale lies in the fertile North Canadian River bottom, which supports the area's long history of farming.",
